<title>UK: Hitachi unit sets $150 mln three-year bond. [CORRECTED 9:37 GMT]</title>
<headline>Hitachi unit sets $150 mln three-year bond. [CORRECTED 9:37 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers IBJ and Goldman Sachs.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HITACHI FINANCE UK</p>
<p> KEEPWELL AGREEMENT HITACHI LTD</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	COUPON     6.625     MATURITY    06.JUN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.0775  PAY DATE    06.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  137.5 BP   REOFFER    99.89     SPREAD	+12 BP</p>
<p>(Lead manager corrects full fees).</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   TAX PROVS  STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    18.75 BP  SELL CONC  118.75 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
